# `min`/`max` over timespans, bools and longs.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/reordered/*.csv'
| summarize mints = min(id * 1h), maxts = max(id * 1h), minb = min(id > 4), maxb = max(id > 4), minl = min(score), maxl = max(score)
---- expected
mints    | maxts    | minb  | maxb | minl | maxl
timespan | timespan | bool  | bool | long | long
---------+----------+-------+------+------+-----
01:00:00 | 08:00:00 | false | true |   10 |   80
